@startuml

title System Context Diagram

actor User

rectangle "Docker Network" {

    node "nginx\nReverse Proxy" as nginx

    node "Frontend SPA\nReact + TypeScript" as frontend

    node "API Service\nExpress + JWT" as api

    database "Redis\nQueue + State Store" as redis
}

User --> nginx : HTTPS Requests

nginx --> frontend : Static Assets
nginx --> api : Reverse Proxy\n/api/*

api --> redis : Queue Operations\nJob State\nRetries\nDLQ

@enduml